        "summary": "Get Lawyer Profile",
        "description": "Returns full lawyer profile with category benchmark fee comparison.\nCalculates dynamic average full_case_estimate for the lawyer's category\nand generates an automated comparison badge.",
        "operationId": "get_lawyer_profile_api_v1_lawyers__lawyer_id__get",
